						411570304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chef Mao"
				},
				{
					"id": 411570304,
					"content": "Whatever the case may be, could I trouble you to deliver this meal to him? <color=#00E1FFFF>Just don't fly about too much,</color> or the soup'll spill out.",
